      "widgets_values": [
        "Instruction: No dialogue - only an emotion-driven scenelet starring Superman and Lois Lane.\n\nSuperman was poisoned and controlled by the scarecrow - tricked into thinking that he was rushing a powerful enemy into space.  But, alas...it wasn't an enemy - it was Lois Lane, pregnant with Superman's child and now...she is dead.\n\nThere's no dialogue here - just the soft hum of space and dramatic music playing in the background of this gripping scene.\n\nSuperman's anguish cannot be constrained; initially distraught and overcome with guilt, his sadness quickly turns into anger and he rushes back to earth in a blur - a streak of pure energy re-entering earth's atmosphere."
